# Neither the card texts nor the sheet that now embeds them are redistributed.
#
# The Liang repo declares no licence and each card carries its own model licence
# on top, so committing card bodies would redistribute third-party text on
# unclear terms -- the same diligence question raised against the modelbiome
# corpus in A17.3, applied to ourselves.
#
# gold_set.csv became self-contained (card text inline) so the sheet is usable
# without opening 150 files, which moved it into the same category as cards/.
#
# Nothing is lost. make_gold_set.py regenerates the sheet from the pinned corpus
# with a fixed seed, and row_hash ties every label to exact text. What gets
# committed is the COMPLETED sheet's labels, which are the author's own work --
# see README.
cards/
gold_set.csv
